<Layouts.app flash={@flash}>
  <h1>AI in Practice</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    A framework from DSC for a conversation about how a senior person works with AI.
  </p>
  <p>
    A short AI-led conversation produces two written reports: a private one for the person, and one they can choose to share with a recruiter, CEO or board member. It is a conversation starter. It gives no score and makes no decision about anyone.
  </p>
  <p>
    Access is by personal link only. If you have been sent a link, open it directly.
  </p>
</Layouts.app>
